    "Cost": 445919,
    "UIName": "Hitotsume Kozo",
    "Id": "chassisdef_hitotsume_kozo_HKZ-1FM",
    "Name": "Hitotsume Kozo",
    "Details": "Debuted in 3139 on the King of the Mountain Arena and piloted by Ming-Na Salonga, this variant replaces its hatchet for a large vibroblade made to resemble a katana. The original hardened armor is replaced with conventional standard armor, making the 'Mech faster and more agile. Otherwise, the Mulan keeps to the original design.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Stable</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.07</color></b>",
